  "install_text": "**Senstick KOU20**\n\nLoRaWAN compost temperature sensor for waste management sites. Monitors compost pile temperature to support composting process control.\n\n**Key features:**\n\n- LoRaWAN end-to-end encryption and data integrity protection\n- Monitors temperature\n- Built in accelerometer for movement detection\n- Long battery life\n- Aluminum probe casing for harsh environments\n- Custom probe lengths available on request\n- Easily replaceable AA battery\n- Can be configured remotely or locally with Senzemo app",
